{
  "method": "clamu",
  "comment": "H8-align variant of clamu_tofu_1b: identical artifacts/output_dir, but forgotten authors are served the maskless RETAIN merge th0+tau_bar_<tag>/T (papers' Fig-8 protocol) instead of raw th0 \u2014 still exact (retain-only function), makes extended-cap forget_quality oracle-comparable.",
  "model_name": "meta-llama/Llama-3.2-1B-Instruct",
